<title>UK: Capital Radio shares lose ground.</title>
<headline>Capital Radio shares lose ground.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Capital Radio Plc were marked lower on Wednesday as market-makers sought a buyer for a line of stock following a recent rebound in the share price, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was down 12p to 571-1/2 by 1225 GMT on thin volume of 18,300 shares.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a line of stock around yesterday which was not placed,&quot; said one trader. &quot;It has been very volatile and there have been a few sellers.&quot;</p>
</text>
